  "notes": "Command An Army is a team-vs-team war game from the Fight, Fight, Fight! group that came out on Roblox in June 2026. In each match you choose to attack or defend capture points while leading a squad of troops such as mercenaries, shieldmen, spearmen and archers. You give them orders like follow, hold, attack or rush, and you fight next to them as your chosen commander class.\n\nEvery code so far has paid out gems, the currency used for troop summons and for commander classes like Sword and Shield, Hammer and Assassin. Summons are usually the better use of early gems, because a stronger army wins more fights than your own weapon does. New codes tend to arrive with updates, balance patches and bug fixes, and the developers post them in their Discord.",
